<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Saflife in talks, issues cautionary.</title>
<headline>Saflife in talks, issues cautionary.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Investment holding company Saflife Ltd cautioned on Thursday that it was involved in discussions which could affect its share price.</p>
<p>Shareholders were advised to exercise caution in their share dealings until a further announcement was made.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
